reaking bond in this unique stop-motion narrative horror adventure.","steam_appid":2301240,"support_info":{"email":"hello@deadlycrowgames.com","url":"support.deadlycrowgames.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://mutter.deadlycrowgames.com"}